  "description": "The META SX V5 ESSENTIAL features FOX Performance and SHIMANO components.\n• The FOX 38 Float Performance fork and Grip cartridge guarantee comfort and reliability and offers three positions. With the large volumes of air and oil, the Float X Performance shock offers consistent operation and maximum Grip. Its MCU stop smoothly handles violent impacts. It is possible to lock it out while pedalling thanks to a dedicated lever.\n• SHIMANO SLX 4-piston brakes with 203mm discs offer a clear feel.\n• DT SWISS take care of the wheels with E 532 tubeless rims specific to enduro. Combined with Formula hubs and Sapim spokes, they are robust and comfortable.\n• A SHIMANO SLX 12-speed drivetrain means easy elevation gain.",
